# Agent engineering workflow

Before substantive work, read `docs/AGENT-ENGINEERING-STANDARDS.md`.

- Create/find a GitHub issue; work on a branch; open a PR that mentions `Fixes #N`.
- Map web tools to Java (OTel/Spotless/ArchUnit/JaCoCo/PIT) — never Biome/Knip/Stryker/Playwright in this Paper repo.
- GUI changes: `design-motion-principles` + `docs/bukkit-gui-motion.md` + `GuiMotion`.
- Prefer Hermes for cheap surveys/drafts; parent reviews before apply.
- Sync issues: `.cursor/skills/rpg-server-plugin/GITHUB-SYNC.md`.
